  "body": "## 更新内容 / What's New（安卓 v0.1.19）\n\n这一版给安卓加了使用统计日历。\n\n入口在「今天」页的「今天用了多久」卡片。打开后是一个月历，可以看到每一天一共用了多久。点某一天，能看到各个应用用了多久，以及打开次数和被拦截次数。\n\n记录会在这台手机上保留 365 天。刚装上或刚升级时，大约能从系统使用记录补回最近 10 天的用量。这些补回来的日子会注明来源，并且没有拦下次数。\n\n不需要新的权限。这些数据只存在这台手机上。\n\n已知限制：这一版还没有在小米真机上复测。小米、OPPO 等机型的后台冻结和无障碍服务被系统关掉的问题，仍需真机确认。部分手机打开受限应用时，仍可能短暂露脸。\n\niPhone 版没有这项功能，也没有更新，仍是目前已发布的 v0.1.5。\n\n## What's New (Android v0.1.19)\n\nThis release adds a usage stats calendar on Android.\n\nThe entry is the \"Time used today\" card on the Today page. It opens a month calendar that shows each day's total time. Tap a day to see how long each app was used, along with open counts and blocked counts.\n\nRecords are kept on the phone for 365 days. After a fresh install or an update, about the last 10 days of usage can be filled in from system usage records. Those days are noted as coming from the system, and they have no block counts.\n\nNo new permissions are required. This data stays on the phone.\n\nKnown limits: this build has not been retested on a Xiaomi phone. Background freeze and accessibility service shutdowns on Xiaomi, OPPO, and similar devices still need real-device checks. On some phones, a restricted app may still flash briefly when opened.\n\nThe usage calendar is not included on iPhone. The iPhone app is unchanged and remains the currently published iOS version, v0.1.5.\n\nversionCode: 40\nsha256: cf8d0755ad5ee9d2afb1271856436d24ba196ccf7b67a99c381092f0060d995a\n",
